import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 921 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 20 | Legalization of the D-Route Human-Made Dao-Rules Soul Rings","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 921 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 20 | Legalization of the D-Route Human-Made Dao-Rules Soul Rings","no":921,"module":5,"tags":["Charter","Article 20","D Route","Human-Made Dao-Rules Soul Rings","Legalization"],"related":["10-300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview","51-Human-Race Positioning and Traits","91-300 Cultivation Systems Index"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0921_模块5-第二十条-D路线人造道则魂环合法化.md","filePath":"en/0921_模块5-第二十条-D路线人造道则魂环合法化.md"}'),o={name:"en/0921_模块5-第二十条-D路线人造道则魂环合法化.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,h,c){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-921-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-article-20-legalization-of-the-d-route-human-made-dao-rules-soul-rings" tabindex="-1">Entry 921 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 20 | Legalization of the D-Route Human-Made Dao-Rules Soul Rings <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-921-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-article-20-legalization-of-the-d-route-human-made-dao-rules-soul-rings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 921 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 20 | Legalization of the D-Route Human-Made Dao-Rules Soul Rings&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 10, 51, 91</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-write-the-human-race-s-original-route-into-the-charter" tabindex="-1">Introduction: write the human race&#39;s original route into the charter <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-write-the-human-race-s-original-route-into-the-charter" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: write the human race&#39;s original route into the charter&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the old Douluo system, soul rings came from hunting soul beasts — naked predation. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization opens a brand-new route for post-humanity: the D route · human-made Dao-rules soul rings — not by hunting, but by law engineering, using technical means to generate Dao-rules soul rings, transforming &quot;soul rings&quot; from predation&#39;s product into creation&#39;s product. Article 20 formally legalizes this route: it is not a side door, but a legitimate evolutionary path the human race contributes to Myriad Ranks outside the 300 systems.</p><p>This article is from beginning to end placed under the six top-level axioms — the anti-predation axiom draws the bottom line, the republican axiom of Myriad Races establishes the subject, the collective-ascension axiom sets the direction, the causal self-discipline axiom guards the boundary, the law-first axiom preserves self-consistency; the five together constitute this article&#39;s insurmountable spiritual boundary.</p><p>Together with the previous five axioms, this article is also bound by Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning.</p><h2 id="i-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">I. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article is based on the 300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview (Document 10)&#39;s &quot;remaining numbers for special clans and special routes&quot; design and the Human-Race Positioning and Traits (Document 51). Its jurisprudential core is the anti-predation axiom&#39;s &quot;develop increments&quot;: the old soul-ring system at the cost of soul-beast life; the D route through law engineering creates increments, eradicating from the root the predatory chain of &quot;hunting to level up.&quot; Legalizing it is legally confirming that &quot;human-made Dao-rules soul rings&quot; have equal status with natural soul rings and with paths within the 300 systems.</p><h2 id="ii-normative-content-three-layers-of-legalization" tabindex="-1">II. Normative Content: Three Layers of Legalization <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-normative-content-three-layers-of-legalization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Normative Content: Three Layers of Legalization&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Article 20 makes the D route&#39;s status clear:</p><ol><li><strong>Legitimate path</strong>: human-made Dao-rules soul rings, as a human-characteristic evolutionary path, are protected by the charter; no institution may dismiss them as &quot;pseudo-cultivation&quot;;</li><li><strong>Unified standards</strong>: D-route cultivators and other-path cultivators are on the same ruler for realm certification, contribution measurement, rights and duties;</li><li><strong>Full-chain opening</strong>: the D route&#39;s law-engineering technology, like the 300 systems, is fully open to Myriad Ranks; no human patent;</li><li><strong>Anti-predation bottom line</strong>: no link of the D route may regress to the old method of &quot;hunting soul beasts, devouring origin&quot;; once discovered, handled under Article 1.</li></ol><h2 id="iii-scope" tabindex="-1">III. Scope <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-scope" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Scope&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article applies to all human cultivators taking the D route, and to other clans willing to adopt this technology. The D route is not the human race&#39;s &quot;private plot&quot; — after full technology opening, any clan may draw on it. This article also binds the D route&#39;s developers: no new monopoly on grounds of &quot;exclusive technology.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Belittling the D route as pseudo-cultivation, refusing to certify its realm, restricting D-route cultivators&#39; rights on clan grounds, re-sealing and monopolizing D-route technology, or actually hunting under the D-route name, all constitute unconstitutionality under this article. Consequences: discriminatory practices are corrected, D-route rights are restored; technology monopoly is handled under Article 6&#39;s full-opening principle; those regressing to hunting are pursued heavily under Article 1 anti-predation.</p><h2 id="v-supervision-mechanism" tabindex="-1">V. Supervision Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervision-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervision Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article is executed by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: D-route cultivators&#39; realm certification goes through a unified process; their soul rings&#39; origin is network-verified as human-made Dao-rules rather than hunted; the Anchor Supervisory Committee monitors whether D-route technology is truly fully open, discovering closure triggers correction.</p><h2 id="vi-the-first-ring-no-longer-draws-blood" tabindex="-1">VI. The First Ring No Longer Draws Blood <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-the-first-ring-no-longer-draws-blood" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. The First Ring No Longer Draws Blood&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The D route&#39;s legalization&#39;s most far-reaching significance is making the first soul ring no longer draw blood. In the old system, every new spirit master&#39;s start meant one soul beast&#39;s death; under the D route, a youth&#39;s first condensing a Dao-rules soul ring relies on a human-made object generated by law engineering, with no being bleeding for it outside the window. This change looks like only a technical replacement, but actually transforms an evolutionary road built on hunting into a new road built on creation. More precious is that this technology is fully open to Myriad Ranks — any clan unwilling to exchange life for power again may take this road.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: law engineering batch-generates soul rings, far more efficient than hunting one by one, and without sacrificing life</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: transforming soul rings from &quot;hunt products&quot; into &quot;creation products&quot; is anti-predation&#39;s thorough transformation on the martial-soul system</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type soul rings rely on hunting soul beasts and might makes right; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s D route human-made Dao-rules, learnable by Myriad Ranks</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: D-route technology is fully open; other clans may also adopt it, not human-exclusive</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the D route, as a supplementary path, together with the 300 systems constitutes an open system</p></li><li><p><strong>Universal equal infinity</strong>: every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher-level infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Legalizing the D route · human-made Dao-rules soul rings is the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s example of transforming the old world&#39;s most typical predation — hunting soul beasts — into creation. It proves: even the bloodiest old setting may, under the anti-predation axiom, be rewritten into a Myriad-Rank-co-created new path.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/10-三百套本源修炼体系总览.html">Entry 10 · 300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/51-人族定位与特质.html">Entry 51 · Human-Race Positioning and Traits</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/91-三百套修炼体系索引.html">Entry 91 · 300 Cultivation Systems Index</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/922_模块5-第二十一条-林昊路线宪法地位.html">Entry 922 · Article 21 Constitutional Status of the Lin Hao Route</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',25)])])}const m=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
